# Task 1 - Predicting House Prices with Linear Regression

Predicting house prices using the Ames Housing Dataset.

## Tech Stack
Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn, Jupyter Notebook

## Models
- Linear Regression
- Ridge Regression
- Lasso Regression

## Evaluation
MSE, RMSE, R²

## Dataset
Ames Housing Dataset